Author: David (dinatih) Herelle <david.herelle@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Jun 27 03:23:47 2026 +0200

    fix: restore X-Bot animations, show custom names in hover menu, and add Verlet physics for pony/braids and breasts
    
    - Run retargetClip unconditionally for all characters (including X-Bot studio which uses prefix-free bone names)
    - Pass specific character name to SingleCharacter to display the correct custom skin name on mouse hover instead of the generic 'Lara'
    - Standardize hair/braid bone names sequentially to hair_1, hair_2, etc. at layout time
    - Recreate ponytail gravity physics using a Verlet simulation chain in the useFrame loop
    - Implement secondary inertia physics (Verlet-based springs) on Lara's breast bones (breast_left_base, breast_right_base) for dynamic movements
    
    Co-authored-by: Antigravity Agent (CLI) <antigravity-agent-cli@deepmind.google>

